Comment: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:26.85,JoJo-Eyecatch2,signbot,0,0,0,,Shini
Comment: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:26.94,JoJo-Eyecatch2,signbot,0,0,0,,Shinin
Comment: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:27.02,JoJo-Eyecatch2,signbot,0,0,0,,Shining
