Comment: 0,0:14:27.15,0:14:27.23,JoJo-Eyecatch2,signbot,0,0,0,,Shining Di
Comment: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:27.31,JoJo-Eyecatch2,signbot,0,0,0,,Shining Dia
Comment: 0,0:14:27.31,0:14:27.40,JoJo-Eyecatch2,signbot,0,0,0,,Shining Diamo
Comment: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:27.48,JoJo-Eyecatch2,signbot,0,0,0,,Shining Diamon
Comment: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:29.44,JoJo-Eyecatch2,signbot,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond
