Comment: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:28.27,JoJo-Eyecatch3,signtop,0,0,0,,Josuke
Comment: 0,0:14:28.27,0:14:28.40,JoJo-Eyecatch3,signtop,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashi
Comment: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:29.44,JoJo-Eyecatch3,signtop,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata
